, "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le10ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le10ob03re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le10ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Before we wrap up our interview, I'd like to ask you one last question.  How would you share your views on the future of technology with people who have no access to computers? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Anderson</span>:    I'm glad you asked. There is a conference next week on this subject. I'm preparing a talk for it. I'm going to show the advances that tech companies are making in this field. For example, Google and Microsoft are giving away computers that kids in poor countries can use at school.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        This is an initiative that more people should know about!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Anderson</span>:    I agree. We're closing the gap between people who have no computer literacy skills and those who own several devices. We expect that the overwhelming majority of the world population will have access to technology by 2020, which is only a few years away!", "id": 2, "time": "29000"}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        That sounds exciting.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Anderson</span>:    It sure is. Do you remember life before the Internet?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Hmm ...  Actually, I don't. I remember my first computer, though! It was so slow ... and so huge! I think my phone has more RAM than the laptop I used in college!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Mr. Anderson</span>:    Well, imagine what someone from the future will say about the technology that we're using today!", "id": 3, "time": "50500"}]}}], "_data": []}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "type": "sena"}